WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:01:05.899 --> 00:01:09.361
I deal with
in my day-to-day life,

00:01:09.402 --> 00:01:13.406
the sound of the highway
that I literally
live right next to.

00:01:32.467 --> 00:01:34.260
( in Spanish )
It's all the time.

00:10:16.491 --> 00:10:18.785 line:0%
( in Spanish )
I noticed most early
in the morning

00:10:18.827 --> 00:10:23.039 line:0%
when the planes
that fly overnight

00:10:23.081 --> 00:10:26.209
would wake me up.

00:10:26.251 --> 00:10:29.004
I have a 13-year-old
and sometimes he gets up

00:10:29.045 --> 00:10:30.797
in the middle
of the night and says,

00:10:30.839 --> 00:10:33.425
"Mom, I can't sleep because
of the airplane noise."

00:10:44.269 --> 00:10:46.438
( in Spanish )
Yes, I think it's not just me,

00:10:46.479 --> 00:10:49.607
but all of the residents
of Chelsea have noticed.

00:10:49.649 --> 00:10:52.027
I think you feel it,

00:10:52.068 --> 00:10:55.447
because all day
you hear noise.

00:10:55.488 --> 00:10:57.365
For example,
I work in a restaurant.

00:10:57.407 --> 00:11:02.871
You hear noise from
the smoke fans in the kitchen,

00:11:02.912 --> 00:11:04.873
you hear the noise
of the plates.

00:11:04.914 --> 00:11:08.460
And you get to your house,
sit down,

00:11:08.501 --> 00:11:12.797
and you want to relax a bit
and you're hearing the noise

00:11:12.839 --> 00:11:14.674
from the planes passing
constantly.

00:11:40.325 --> 00:11:43.787
( in Spanish )
We're an undocumented
community.

00:11:43.828 --> 00:11:45.663
We're a community
of immigrants.

00:11:45.705 --> 00:11:49.668
We come from our countries
resigned to the fact

00:11:49.709 --> 00:11:52.295
that they won't listen to us,

00:11:52.337 --> 00:11:55.715
and so sometimes we're afraid
to raise our voices.

00:12:01.554 --> 00:12:06.101
I don't know if we could
have a schedule

00:12:06.142 --> 00:12:09.688
for stopping
the flights at night.

00:12:09.729 --> 00:12:15.318
What we have to do
is organize the people

00:12:15.360 --> 00:12:17.737
so that our complaints
are heard.

00:18:34.823 --> 00:18:38.243
( in Spanish )
It effects me emotionally.

00:18:38.284 --> 00:18:40.328
When we don't rest well,

00:18:40.370 --> 00:18:44.958
your nerves
are a bit altered.

00:20:19.636 --> 00:20:21.805
¡Pásale, pásale,
pásale, pásale!

00:20:21.846 --> 00:20:25.100
Yeah, to me that is
the sound of Mexico City.

